{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6SEQHPX9SPDES955N3BYY0Q"},{"$ref":"01M6SEVHJVA61Y6R09ECN3EJAK"}],"opens":"A store's point is sometimes not to forget but to pack up and leave: a whole that rests upon another, pointing into it, and stands when carried away, as a stream buffer does. And forgetting is allowed: lifetimes exist, and the end of a thing is decided at the point of its creation. Inference runs are large; the analysis upon them goes as deep as it goes and is made separate, and the runs beneath it may end when their lifetime does. Storage is hot and cold as well, parts of reality; a store given a real lifetime, as things are locked or expired in a bucket. A capacity for the future, pointed to, not yet built.","restsOn":["a store declaring its lifetime, by contract","storage that honours it: retention and expiry","streams, being specced by the first session"],"stands":"noted","title":"Stores that rest on stores, with a lifetime"},"id":"01M6SEQHQ1M2795MQG32CVH40Q","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
